### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Register an organizer
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Riya Organizer",
  "email": "riya@events.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "role": "organizer"
}

### Register an attendee
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kunal Sharma",
  "email": "kunal@gmail.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "role": "attendee"
}

### Login as organizer (copy the token into @organizerToken)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "riya@events.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Login as attendee (copy the token into @attendeeToken)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kunal@gmail.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

@organizerToken = PASTE_ORGANIZER_TOKEN
@attendeeToken = PASTE_ATTENDEE_TOKEN
@eventId = PASTE_EVENT_ID
@ticketId = PASTE_TICKET_ID

### Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{attendeeToken}}

### Create an event with only 5 seats (organizer)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Global Cloud & AI Summit 2026",
  "description": "Annual flagship backend conference",
  "category": "Technology",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-15T09:00:00Z",
  "venue": "Bandra Kurla Complex, Mumbai",
  "city": "Mumbai",
  "ticketPrice": 1499,
  "totalCapacity": 5
}

### Browse upcoming events (public)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events?category=Technology&city=Mumbai

### Browse completed events
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events?status=completed

### Event details + live remaining tickets
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events/{{eventId}}

### Update event (organizer, owner only)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketPrice": 1299,
  "totalCapacity": 6
}

### Attendee tries to create an event -> 403
POST http://localhost:5000/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{attendeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Nope" }

### Book 2 tickets (attendee) -- send 11 times in a minute to see 429
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tickets/book
Authorization: Bearer {{attendeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "{{eventId}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Book more than what is left -> 409
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tickets/book
Authorization: Bearer {{attendeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "{{eventId}}",
  "quantity": 10
}

### My tickets
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tickets/my-tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{attendeeToken}}

### Cancel a ticket (seats go back to the event)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{attendeeToken}}

### Attendee list (organizer, owner only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events/{{eventId}}/attendees
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### Cancel + delete event (organizer, owner only)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
